  "acceptance": [
    {
      "id": "AC-001",
      "text": "用户级同步将 xian-commit 与所有 xian-* skills 以软链注册到 ~/.agents/skills 及 Qoder/Codex/Claude 全局目录；重复执行幂等，不覆盖非受管路径。",
      "group": "business"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-002",
      "text": "status/verify/uninstall 只处理本工具管理的软链；冲突或外部实体保持不动并明确报告。",
      "group": "business"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-003",
      "text": "全局 xian-commit skill 在缺少 .xian-commit/.xian-harness 的仓库中降级为通用提交规范，不声称 hooks 生效；工程级安装行为不变。",
      "group": "business"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-004",
      "text": "中英文 README 说明用户级安装、目标目录、守卫、版本漂移边界和卸载方式。",
      "group": "business"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-005",
      "text": "Generated contract views, tasks, and verification mappings remain consistent with the captured facts.",
      "group": "technical"
    }
  ],
